{
  "title": "Array exists, no effect",
  "pages": [
    {
      "components": [
        {
          "type": "modopedia:header",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "text": "Array exists, no effect",
          "centered": true,
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "modopedia:text",
          "x": 2,
          "y": 16,
          "width": 96,
          "line_height": 9,
          "text": "A registered array does not mean every center has a direct effect. Some centers are semantic anchors that need operation runes or nested operations; other effects happen only on"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "server ticks, collisions, or discard."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• Check that element ticks are enabled and concentrations are not zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• If an entity exists but is invisible, check its client renderer, projection plane, and Photon/VFX resources."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• When an array breaks, verify EndEffect cleanup so old entities are not mistaken for new output."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "$(el:elements.01)Read the nine elements$(/el)"
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "$(el:operators.03)Read persistent operations$(/el)"
    }
  ]
